{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57416","headline":"同音韵诗 · 无名氏","name":"同音韵诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今朝是何夕，良人谁观觌。\n中心实怜爱，夜寐不安席。\n（以上六首均见《文镜秘府论校注》天卷《八种韵》）（按：《八种韵》节凡引诗九首，除梁萧绎、唐王昌龄、李白各一首外，余六首作者不详。\n王利器《文镜秘府论校注》引任学良《文镜秘府论校注》稿本云：「本节曾引王昌龄李白诗，疑系元兢《脑髓》之文，皎然《诗议》不致有此种琐屑声）（韵之论也。\n」然兢爲高宗时人，安得引及李、王之诗。\n其说未谛。\n诸诗爲六朝至盛唐间作品，殆无可疑。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57416.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57416","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}